| description = The [[Rivervale]] [[Druid]] guild devotes themselves to [[Karana]], god of the Storms, to ensure the timely arrival of rain to raise their precious Jumjum crops. They are naturally allied with [[Mayor Gubbin]], mayor of Rivervale, the local sheriff and his [[Guardians of the Vale]], and the [[Merchants of Rivervale]]. They fight alongside other halflings in their war against the vile, existential threat: [[Clan Runnyeye]] and [[Pickclaw Goblins]].

* Iksar Monk - 505 Storm Reaper increases to get to Dubious (with [[Ella Foodcrafter]]).  11 [[Mooto]] kills, 55 [[Orc Belts]], 16 [[Runnyeye Warbeads (Rivervale)]], the rest were Goblin kills in Misty, Butcherblock, and Runnyeye.  I used [[Bandages for Honeybugger]] to enable me to bank and talk to the Sheriff.

